#: ../../source/docs/common-smartap-pdb.rst:53
#: eccd058310bd4f51bec467848e68e6e6
msgid "SmartAP Power Distribution Board pinout diagram is shown below. Big pads in the rear side are intended for the main battery connection. Up to four independent batteries can be connected using the thick wires (e.g. 8-10 AWG) to be able to handle high current loads and even more using thinner wires. Both top and bottom, left and right sides have pads for ESCs power supply connection. Therefore, up to 12 ESCs can be connected."
msgstr ""

